=== 0. SYNTHETIC catalogue (composition invented for the proof; only ENS_ID/CLEPERS/DESC come from the .qpl) ===
=== 1. Header (SOUMIS): EXTFILE = the .qpl file, UMPLAN = unit of plan measurements ===
=== 2. One block per plan that carries a linked object (SOUBLO, BLO_ID numeric for fn_MultBlock), one division per layer (SOUDIV) ===
=== 3. Quote copies of the catalogue: ENSEMBLE -> SOUENS, ENSCOMPO -> SOUENSCO, PRODUITS -> SOUPRO (no SQL procedure does this; the application does) ===
=== 4. Takeoff lines (SOUREL, TYPERELEVE=P): one per plan x layer x linked group; EXT_ID = GroupID ===
=== 5. Not importable: drawn objects whose group has no EEExchangeData (no ITEM_ID -> nothing to price) ===
=== 6. Roll-up: sp_SOUPRO_Quantity_V2 -> SOUPRO.QTEENS / QTEOTH ===
